<view class="page"><view class="hint">题图上传方案确定前，请粘贴图床的 HTTPS 图片直链；答题页可点击查看原图。</view><view class="form-card"><textarea class="textarea" placeholder="题目文字" value="{{form.text}}" data-field="text" bindinput="updateField" auto-height maxlength="500" /><view class="difficulty-picker"><text>题目难度</text><view><text wx:for="{{[1,2,3,4,5]}}" wx:key="*this" data-value="{{item}}" bind:tap="selectDifficulty" class="star {{item <= form.difficulty ? 'active' : ''}}">★</text></view></view><view class="image-url"><view class="option-label">题图 HTTPS 链接（可选）</view><input placeholder="https://pan.yurucamp.cn/..." value="{{form.imageUrl}}" data-field="imageUrl" bindinput="updateField" /><image wx:if="{{form.imageUrl}}" src="{{form.imageUrl}}" class="thumbnail" mode="aspectFill" /></view><view class="option-label">填写选项</view><view class="input-row"><text>A</text><input placeholder="选项 A" value="{{form.optionA}}" data-field="optionA" bindfocus="selectOption" bindinput="updateField" /></view><view class="input-row"><text>B</text><input placeholder="选项 B" value="{{form.optionB}}" data-field="optionB" bindfocus="selectOption" bindinput="updateField" /></view><view class="input-row"><text>C</text><input placeholder="选项 C" value="{{form.optionC}}" data-field="optionC" bindfocus="selectOption" bindinput="updateField" /></view><view class="input-row"><text>D</text><input placeholder="选项 D" value="{{form.optionD}}" data-field="optionD" bindfocus="selectOption" bindinput="updateField" /></view><view wx:if="{{fontPresets.length}}" class="preset-box"><view class="preset-title">快捷字体输入（将填入当前选中的选项）</view><view class="preset-list"><text wx:for="{{fontPresets}}" wx:key="*this" class="preset" data-value="{{item}}" bind:tap="insertPreset">{{item}}</text></view></view><radio-group class="answer-row" bindchange="selectAnswer"><text>正确答案</text><label wx:for="{{['A','B','C','D']}}" wx:key="*this"><radio value="{{item}}" checked="{{form.answer === item}}" color="#ff9800" />{{item}}</label></radio-group><view class="analysis-title">题目解析</view><textarea class="textarea analysis-input" placeholder="填写所有用户都会看到的统一解析" value="{{form.explanation}}" data-field="explanation" bindinput="updateField" auto-height maxlength="1000" /><button class="save" loading="{{saving}}" bind:tap="saveQuestion">保存到题库</button></view></view>
